#: ../../site/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture and design choices"
msgstr "架构与设计取舍"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:3
msgid ""
"This page explains how the library is put together and why the public "
"surface looks the way it does. It is the \"why\" companion to the reference,"
" which is the \"what\"."
msgstr "本页说明库是如何组织的，以及公共接口为什么是现在这个样子。它是参考的“为什么”伴侣，参考回答的是“是什么”。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:7
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "分层"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:9
msgid ""
"data            dataframe, calendar, UTC timestamps, frequency helpers\n"
"metrics         returns, ratios, drawdowns, rolling windows, statistics\n"
"domain          risk, portfolio, factor, attribution, optimization\n"
"presentation    report documents, HTML/XLSX/PDF/Plotly/Bokeh/axes renderers\n"
"runtime         operation catalog, sessions, serialization, extensions\n"
msgstr ""
"data            dataframe, calendar, UTC timestamps, frequency helpers\n"
"metrics         returns, ratios, drawdowns, rolling windows, statistics\n"
"domain          risk, portfolio, factor, attribution, optimization\n"
"presentation    report documents, HTML/XLSX/PDF/Plotly/Bokeh/axes renderers\n"
"runtime         operation catalog, sessions, serialization, extensions\n"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:17
msgid ""
"Each layer may use the ones above it and never below it: a metric does not "
"know about report documents, and a renderer never recomputes a statistic. "
"That is why the report model carries values rather than frames — rendering "
"cannot change a number, only present it."
msgstr ""
"每一层可以使用它上面的层，绝不使用下面的层：指标不知道报表文档的存在，渲染器也从不重算统计量。这就是报表模型携带数值而不是帧的原因 —— "
"渲染不能改变数字，只能呈现它。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:22
msgid "Ownership"
msgstr "所有权"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:24
msgid ""
"One rule explains most of the API shape: **inputs are copied at the "
"boundary, and results own their data**."
msgstr "一条规则解释了大部分 API 形状：**输入在边界处复制，结果拥有自己的数据**。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:27
msgid ""
"`portfolio_inputs`, `analysis_context` and `rolling_engine` take their "
"frames by value and store their own copy, so a caller can mutate a source "
"frame without changing a result already produced."
msgstr ""
"`portfolio_inputs`、`analysis_context` 与 `rolling_engine` "
"以按值方式接收帧并保存自己的副本，因此调用方修改源帧不会改变已经产出的结果。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:30
msgid ""
"Functions that return a `dataframe` return a new frame. Accessors that "
"return a span or `std::string_view` are views and are valid only while their"
" owner is alive."
msgstr "返回 `dataframe` 的函数返回新帧。返回 span 或 `std::string_view` 的访问器是视图，只在其所有者存活期间有效。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:33
msgid ""
"`materialize()` returns fresh frames on every call, which is why mutating "
"its result cannot corrupt the next call."
msgstr "`materialize()` 每次调用都返回新帧，这正是修改其结果不会破坏下一次调用的原因。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:36
msgid ""
"The trade-off is allocation against predictability. For the daily and "
"monthly panel sizes this library targets, predictable ownership was judged "
"worth the copy; the benchmark harness exists to keep that judgment honest at"
" larger scales."
msgstr "这里的取舍是分配与可预测性。对本库面向的日频与月频面板规模，可预测的所有权值得这份复制；基准框架的存在就是为了在更大规模上让这个判断保持诚实。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:40
msgid "Determinism"
msgstr "确定性"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:42
msgid "Anything that could be compared, stored or replayed is reduced to a digest:"
msgstr "任何可能被比较、存储或重放的东西都被归约为摘要："

#: ../../site/architecture.md:44
msgid ""
"Runtime serialization length-prefixes each field and tags its type, so two "
"different payloads cannot collide through separators or a `bool`/`1` "
"ambiguity."
msgstr "运行时序列化给每个字段加长度前缀并标注类型，因此两份不同载荷不会因为分隔符或 `bool`/`1` 的歧义而碰撞。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:47
msgid ""
"The factor fingerprint hashes **inputs**; report digests cover the "
"**document**, so two backends rendering one document agree by construction."
msgstr "因子 fingerprint 哈希的是**输入**；报表摘要覆盖**文档**，因此渲染同一文档的两个后端在构造上一致。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:49
msgid ""
"Floating-point values are serialized as IEEE-754 bit patterns where the "
"bytes matter, which preserves `NaN` payloads and signed zeros."
msgstr "字节重要的场合，浮点值按 IEEE-754 位模式序列化，从而保留 `NaN` 载荷与带符号零。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:52
msgid ""
"Randomised methods take an explicit seed. A seed reproduces a stream inside "
"this library; only functions that document a reference mapping promise "
"NumPy-identical numbers."
msgstr "随机方法接受显式种子。种子只在本库内复现一条流；只有文档写明参考映射的函数才承诺与 NumPy 相同的数值。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:56
msgid "Errors and degenerate results"
msgstr "错误与退化结果"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:58
msgid ""
"The library distinguishes three outcomes, and the distinction is part of the"
" contract rather than an implementation detail:"
msgstr "库区分三种结果，而这种区分是契约的一部分，不是实现细节："

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Outcome"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Example"
msgstr "例子"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Exception (`input_error`, `factor_data_error`)"
msgstr "异常（`input_error`、`factor_data_error`）"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "The request is structurally wrong"
msgstr "请求在结构上是错的"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Missing column, duplicated index, embedded NUL"
msgstr "列缺失、索引重复、内嵌 NUL"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "`NaN`"
msgstr "`NaN`"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "The request is well formed but the statistic is undefined"
msgstr "请求本身合法，但统计量无定义"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Too few observations, zero deviation, no drawdown"
msgstr "观测太少、零偏差、无回撤"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Status field"
msgstr "状态字段"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "A fit or validation ran and reports its own verdict"
msgstr "拟合或校验确实运行并给出自己的结论"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "`risk_estimate_status`, `walk_forward_status`, `risk_backtest_status`"
msgstr "`risk_estimate_status`、`walk_forward_status`、`risk_backtest_status`"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:67
msgid ""
"A status field exists precisely so callers do not have to infer failure from"
" a plausible-looking number."
msgstr "状态字段存在的意义，正是让调用方不必从一个看起来合理的数字里推断失败。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:70
msgid "Concurrency"
msgstr "并发"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:72
msgid ""
"Free functions are stateless: the same arguments produce the same result, "
"and two threads may call them concurrently on separate frames. Stateful "
"objects are explicit:"
msgstr "自由函数是无状态的：相同参数产生相同结果，两个线程可以在各自帧上并发调用。有状态对象是显式的："

#: ../../site/architecture.md:76
msgid ""
"`analysis_context` caches results, so one instance is single-threaded by "
"construction."
msgstr "`analysis_context` 会缓存结果，因此单个实例在构造上就是单线程的。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:78
msgid ""
"`analysis_session` owns its inputs and outputs and refuses calls after "
"`close()`."
msgstr "`analysis_session` 拥有自己的输入与输出，并在 `close()` 之后拒绝调用。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:80
msgid "`rolling_engine` owns copies and is safe to use from one thread at a time."
msgstr "`rolling_engine` 拥有副本，一次只宜在一个线程中使用。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:82
msgid ""
"No hidden thread pools, no global caches, and no background work: a call "
"does what it says before it returns."
msgstr "没有隐藏的线程池、没有全局缓存、没有后台工作：一次调用在返回之前就完成了它承诺的事。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:85
msgid "Extension points"
msgstr "扩展点"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Point"
msgstr "扩展点"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "契约"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Data providers"
msgstr "数据提供者"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "A callable that returns a frame; validation and digesting stay in the library"
msgstr "返回帧的可调用对象；校验与摘要仍留在库内"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Report backends"
msgstr "报表后端"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "A renderer consumes `report_document` and returns an owning artifact bundle"
msgstr "渲染器消费 `report_document` 并返回拥有的 artifact bundle"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid ""
"Native snapshot/hook ABI: hooks carry an event and a priority, ties break by"
" fingerprint"
msgstr "原生快照/hook ABI：hook 携带事件与优先级，并列时按 fingerprint 决定"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid "Operations"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../site/architecture.md
msgid ""
"Descriptors list inputs and outputs; execution returns a typed "
"`runtime_value`"
msgstr "描述符列出输入与输出；执行返回带类型的 `runtime_value`"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:94
msgid ""
"Optional surfaces stay optional: the ImPlot adapter and its GUI dependencies"
" are never on the core `fincore::fincore` path."
msgstr "可选接口保持可选：ImPlot 适配器及其 GUI 依赖永远不会出现在核心 `fincore::fincore` 路径上。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:97
msgid "What is deliberately not here"
msgstr "刻意不提供的东西"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:99
msgid ""
"**No Python object compatibility.** `fincore::dataframe` is its own type; "
"the parity work is about numbers, not object identity."
msgstr "**不承诺 Python 对象兼容。** `fincore::dataframe` 是自己的类型；parity 工作关注数值，而不是对象身份。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:101
msgid ""
"**No implicit data access.** Nothing downloads a price series or reads a "
"file behind your back; I/O is the caller's decision."
msgstr "**没有隐式数据访问。** 不会在你不知情时下载价格序列或读文件；I/O 是调用方的决定。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:103
msgid ""
"**No unit conversion.** Returns are decimal fractions, annualization is an "
"argument, and weights carry their call-site meaning."
msgstr "**不做单位换算。** 收益是小数分数，年化是参数，权重沿用调用处的含义。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:105
msgid ""
"**No silent repair.** A duplicated index is rejected, not deduplicated; a "
"missing observation is `NaN`, not zero."
msgstr "**不做静默修复。** 重复索引会被拒绝而不是去重；缺失观测是 `NaN`，不是 0。"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:108
msgid "How the documentation mirrors this"
msgstr "文档如何映射这一点"

#: ../../site/architecture.md:110
msgid ""
"The site follows the same split: the tutorial and cookbook show usage, the "
"guides explain behaviour, the reference is generated from the headers, and "
"this page explains the structure. Publication state lives in the repository "
"and is never asserted on the home page."
msgstr "站点遵循同样的划分：教程与配方集展示用法，指南解释行为，参考由头文件生成，本页解释结构。发布状态存放在仓库中，从不在首页上断言。"

